  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "title",
      "type": "title",
      "source": "RPG制作講座目次",
      "sourceHash": "8c063cb233c07ea8905edf7b64ef060afea53ee59997eed7d7f58088de2946dc",
      "translation": "RPG Design Guides Table of Contents",
      "contextHash": "8c063cb233c07ea8905edf7b64ef060afea53ee59997eed7d7f58088de2946dc"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-001",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "ここでは、僕の長年のＲＰＧ制作経験を元に、色々と思い付いたことをまとめてみます。",
      "sourceHash": "3a2ff5c390c71586929e52b8d6af5de1ad5ed8c2a89df1716a0c93c7c62b6769",
      "translation": "Here, I’ll compile various ideas I’ve come up with based on my many years of RPG development experience.",
      "contextHash": "3a2ff5c390c71586929e52b8d6af5de1ad5ed8c2a89df1716a0c93c7c62b6769"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-002",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "プログラミング技術よりも、ゲームバランスの調整法といった内容がメインなので悪しからずです。やや押し付けがましく書いてしまった気がしないでもないので、自分なりに噛み砕いて読んで貰えればと思います。",
      "sourceHash": "f4d74a059e1bdf7165f3cc0506bf00950f2b847740c478eebfc8797dda933862",
      "translation": "Please note that the main focus is on topics such as methods for fine-tuning game balance rather than programming techniques. I may have written some of it in a somewhat preachy manner, so I hope you’ll read it and interpret it in your own way.",
      "contextHash": "f4d74a059e1bdf7165f3cc0506bf00950f2b847740c478eebfc8797dda933862"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-003",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "王道長編ＲＰＧ『雲海のフロンティア』販売中です！",
      "sourceHash": "0dd0c8dde4e0e64fc84228cb40d91db6bcf0d898a7e881dbb02432c74b617972",
      "translation": "The classic epic RPG “Cloudsea Frontier” is now available!",
      "contextHash": "0dd0c8dde4e0e64fc84228cb40d91db6bcf0d898a7e881dbb02432c74b617972"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-004",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "当講座を読んでご興味を持たれた方はぜひプレイしてみてください。",
      "sourceHash": "1073cab9bf05fc9f1af5ffbc79da46a3dfe22c2ea458d035433a1783957e95cf",
      "translation": "If reading these guides has piqued your interest, please give it a try.",
      "contextHash": "1073cab9bf05fc9f1af5ffbc79da46a3dfe22c2ea458d035433a1783957e95cf"
    },
